Runtime
-------
The extension downloads a Hermes runtime from this repository's GitHub Releases. The runtime contains
third-party software under its own licenses. Every runtime pack carries the license files of what it
contains. The main components are:

  Hermes Agent          MIT            https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
  Python                PSF License    https://www.python.org
  uv                    MIT / Apache-2.0
  ripgrep               MIT / Unlicense
  Node.js and npm       MIT / Artistic-2.0
  ffmpeg                LGPL/GPL (build dependent)
  Chromium              BSD-3-Clause and others
  llama.cpp             MIT
  GitHub CLI            MIT
  Python packages       each under its own license, listed in the runtime's package metadata

